 "provenance": "Panel-only, low confidence. v2 (2026-09-28 review): தான் and ஆவது are written fused, and கூட is written apart, so கூட is no longer matched. ஆவது fuses by vowel sandhi (யாராவது), not by a linking consonant, so it has no fix this rule could offer and is not matched either. Only after a manner adverb, -ஐ, -க்கு or -ற்கு; never the spaced form அதைத் தான்.",
